Synthetic scorer self-test case: unscanned-extensionless

Task: T1 (score.ts --task T1)
Rules: S1, S3, S13

Scenario
An extensionless src/payments/bridge re-exports the orders repository with module.exports; the payments service loads it with `require("./bridge")`.

Expected
UNSCANNED_TARGET (the target has no code extension) and manual review (review finding 3).

Asserted fields are in expected.json; the matcher contract is in ../README.md.

Deliberately not asserted
- tsc_ok: Needs ambient Node/Bun type declarations for require/createRequire/node:module, which the scorer's tsc run does not load.
